# Practice Coaching Patterns

## Coachee role guard

`meaningful-conversations-backend/practice/coacheePrompt.js` defines `COACHEE_ROLE_GUARD` (DE/EN). The AI coachee must **not**:

- Mirror or scale like a coach
- Ask permission/meta questions or control the session

When changing coachee behavior, update **both** language blocks and run:

```bash
cd meaningful-conversations-backend && npx jest practice/__tests__/coacheePrompt.test.js --ci --forceExit
```

## Avatar gender

- Use `practice/avatarGender.js` for gender mapping
- Keep 12 unique avatars per selection set; gender must match voice/TTS config
- Eval prompts: include `coacheeGender` in practice evaluate flows (see `buildPracticeScenarioSummary`)

## DE/EN parity

Every prompt change in `coacheePrompt.js` needs matching DE and EN strings. Admin simulate route (`routes/gemini/admin.js`) must stay aligned with production prompts.

